cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using its data, analyses, or generated artifacts."
type: software
title: "Reproducible Analysis of the Wow! Signal"
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Lovell
    given-names: Bryce
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, evidence-bound forensic analysis of the 1977 Wow! signal,
  including printer-bin reconstruction, beam-transit modeling, hydrogen-line
  context, exhaustive threshold and International Morse tests, exact
  permutation controls, uncertainty analysis, and explicit claim boundaries.
keywords:
  - wow-signal
  - 6equj5
  - seti
  - technosignatures
  - radio-astronomy
  - signal-processing
  - reproducible-research
